  triage:title "hermes-graft-binding.toml response_types omits PyObservability and PyGraftSessionSnapshot, which AW.5 newly registers as public pymodule classes" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1184-r1 ruthless-boundary-qa (quality-mgr msg 01M1QXH12PE2ARX4YJGHHSCRE2, independently confirmed): boundaries/atm-graft-python/hermes-graft-binding.toml response_types (line 40) still lists the 9-item AW.4 set, but the AW.5 diff adds m.add_class for PyObservability and PyGraftSessionSnapshot in crates/atm-graft-python/src/lib.rs, both returned from getters. Undeclared public surface. Fix: add both to response_types. Process gap noted for follow-up outside this sprint: no lint enforces response_types against actual add_class calls." ;
